2. ChillPill-Shell -- design only, no code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

    https://github.com/LUCKYS1NGHH/ChillPill-Shell
    GPLv3, v0.3.1

No source code, images, sounds or other assets from ChillPill-Shell are
included in or distributed with this project.  What was taken is factual
design data: the morph size table, colour values, animation durations and
configuration key names, all of which are reproduced in docs/SPEC.md and
implemented independently in PyQt6.

Design inspired by ChillPill-Shell by LUCKYS1NGHH.

The name "ChillPill-Win" is used pending the original author's agreement; see
docs/CREDITS.md for the alternatives held in reserve.
